<mxCell id="cell_12" value="&lt;b&gt;🤖 AI-Augmented Extraction &amp;amp; Validation Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px;color:#475569;&apos;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Tavily &amp;amp; Google Grounding:&lt;/b&gt; Real-time targeted web extraction&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Pydantic Schemas:&lt;/b&gt; Strict entity type validation &amp;amp; deduplication&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Temporal Tagging:&lt;/b&gt; Applies &lt;code&gt;valid_from&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;valid_to&lt;/code&gt;, and &lt;code&gt;is_current&lt;/code&gt;&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Provenance Ledger:&lt;/b&gt; Links every fact to source name, credibility tier &amp;amp; score&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E0F2FE;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
