<mxCell id="cell_35" value="&lt;b&gt;🤖 SLM Intent &amp;amp; Query Planner (Gemma 9B / Gemini Flash)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px;color:#78350F;&apos;&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;Natural Language Parsing:&lt;/b&gt; Extracts entities (&apos;Dzire&apos;, &apos;Amaze&apos;), intent (&apos;Compare&apos;, &apos;Simulate Price Cut&apos;)&lt;br/&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;Tool &amp;amp; Query Routing:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;   • Common questions ➔ Routes to &lt;b&gt;Deterministic Parameterized Tools&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;   • Open-ended inquiries ➔ Generates &lt;b&gt;Schema-Aware Read-Only Cypher&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;Guardrailed Validator:&lt;/b&gt; Rejects write operations (MERGE, SET, DELETE); enforces timeouts &amp;amp; row limits&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF3C7;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
