<mxCell id="cell_37" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #9A3412;&apos;&gt;🔍 PATH A: SCHEMA-AWARE DYNAMIC CYPHER EXECUTION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px;color:#334155;&apos;&gt;• Generates custom read-only multi-hop queries based on user questions&lt;br/&gt;• Validates AST against Neo4j Metamodel (rejects arbitrary hallucinated labels)&lt;br/&gt;• Executes with strict parameterization and LIMIT 50 controls&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#D97706;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1415" y="370" width="550" height="100" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="cell_38" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #9A3412;&apos;&gt;🎯 1. AUDIENCE–VEHICLE FIT SCORING ENGINE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&apos;background: #FFF7ED; padding: 4px; margin: 3px 0; border: 1px solid #FFEDD5; border-radius: 4px; font-family: monospace; font-size: 10px; text-align: center; color: #C2410C;&apos;&gt;Fit(s, v) = ( ∑ w_{s,i} × a_{v,i} ) / ( ∑ w_{s,i} )&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px;color:#334155;&apos;&gt;• Reads node properties (&lt;code&gt;ncap_rating&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;boot_space&lt;/code&gt;, &lt;code&gt;mileage&lt;/code&gt;) dynamically&lt;br/&gt;• Mathematically computes persona fit across 21 models with grounded trade-offs&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFEDD5;strokeColor=#EA580C;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1415" y="485" width="550" height="130" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="cell_39" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #9A3412;&apos;&gt;🥊 2. COMPETITIVE GAP &amp;amp; VULNERABILITY ENGINE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px;color:#334155;&apos;&gt;• Head-to-head feature win/loss comparison (&lt;code&gt;gap_analysis.py&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;• Computes unaddressed opportunity scores: &lt;code&gt;Opportunity_Gap = (1 - Score) × Weight&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#EF4444;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
  <mxGeometry x="1415" y="630" width="550" height="95" as="geometry"/>
</mxCell>
<mxCell id="cell_40" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: #9A3412;&apos;&gt;⚡ 3. CAUSAL MARKET CHANGE &amp;amp; IMPACT TRACER&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px;color:#334155;&apos;&gt;• Multi-hop traversal of real market disruptions (&lt;code&gt;impact_tracer.py&lt;/code&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;• Propagates event ripple (e.g. Dzire 5★ NCAP leap ➔ pressures Amaze &amp;amp; Aura)&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
