<mxCell id="cell_49" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#7C3AED; margin-bottom:4px;&apos;&gt;💼 1. PRODUCT PLANNING &amp;amp; TRIM OPTIMIZATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px; color:#1E293B;&apos;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Problem:&lt;/b&gt; Avoid tooling costs by discovering which features (e.g. 6 airbags, rear AC) trigger purchase decisions vs bloat MSRP.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Action:&lt;/b&gt; Evaluates feature satisfaction paths before vehicle manufacturing.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F3E8FF;strokeColor=#7C3AED;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
