<mxCell id="cell_50" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#A21CAF; margin-bottom:4px;&apos;&gt;🎯 2. PRECISION CUSTOMER SEGMENTATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px; color:#1E293B;&apos;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Problem:&lt;/b&gt; Eliminates demographic guesswork.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Action:&lt;/b&gt; Computes verified Persona Fit Scores (Urban Families vs Gig Workers), identifying purchase drivers and friction barriers.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDF4FF;strokeColor=#A21CAF;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
