<mxCell id="cell_51" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#E11D48; margin-bottom:4px;&apos;&gt;🥊 3. COMPETITIVE BATTLEGROUND DEFENSE&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px; color:#1E293B;&apos;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Problem:&lt;/b&gt; Pinpoint rival vulnerabilities before market share dips.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Action:&lt;/b&gt; Automated head-to-head gap analysis with pricing ladder overlap and feature exclusivity matrices.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
