<mxCell id="cell_52" value="&lt;div style=&apos;font-size:12px; font-weight:700; color:#059669; margin-bottom:4px;&apos;&gt;💰 4. PRICING &amp;amp; CANNIBALIZATION SIMULATION&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px; color:#1E293B;&apos;&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Problem:&lt;/b&gt; Test pricing moves without cannibalizing internal trims.&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Action:&lt;/b&gt; Counterfactual forecasting simulates volume elasticity across trims based on verified SIAM historical dispatches.&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ECFDF5;strokeColor=#059669;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
