</mxCell>
<mxCell id="cell_53" value="&lt;b&gt;🔄 Closed-Loop Operational Recalibration Pipeline&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style=&apos;font-size:10px;color:#9F1239;&apos;&gt;1. &lt;b&gt;Observed Sales &amp;amp; Price Feed:&lt;/b&gt; Real SIAM monthly data and price cuts update observations&lt;br/&gt;2. &lt;b&gt;Residual Calibration:&lt;/b&gt; Forecast errors adjust price elasticity coefficients (η) in World Model&lt;br/&gt;3. &lt;b&gt;Weight Drift Adaptation:&lt;/b&gt; Shifts in search trends re-weight customer buying factors automatically&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF1F2;strokeColor=#E11D48;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=12;shadow=1;arcSize=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
